  SceneName: TwinSpans
  DisplayName: Twin Spans
  PlayerCount: 6
  SizeTag: LARGE / 3v3
  Description: "Three warbands to a shore, split by a river nothing fords. Two stone bridges carry every attack, and a well stands at each of the four bridgeheads - the map is its crossings. Veilsteel lies behind each shore, so late tech means holding ground, not sitting on it."
